{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderfing.gif?t=1749511109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sunset Inferno is a narrative-driven adventure RPG where your choices shape your fate and the lives of those around you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who built you? Who broke you? <strong>What are you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bomb goes off on the highway. A truck flips. You fall out. You were not a passenger.\u00a0You were not the driver. You were the cargo. A tool built for a purpose you can barely remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/bordercrop_ct.gif?t=1749511109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now you wander the streets of an unfamiliar city, something stirring inside you: <i>doubt</i>. And far below, beneath layers of concrete and iron, something ancient is watching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pick your skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three core skills. Each one shapes how you see the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderskillscropped.gif?t=1749511109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become The Recycler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn what you were built for, and why someone tried to destroy you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082700/extras/borderrecycler.gif?t=1749511109\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the Listening Device</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tap into hidden thoughts and memories. Track signals to your next destination.</p><p 